t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"boxed_image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest?cb=20250220182005\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Missing Image\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250220182005 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Missing_Image.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250220182005 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Missing Image\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Missing_Image.png\" data-image-name=\"Missing Image.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Santa's Workshop</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">❄️32,500</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Turns items and structures into openable gift items.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"version_added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.97.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i>\"A special tool that lets you gift any item or structure into a present!\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Gift Wrapper</b> is an exclusive <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Christmas_Event\" title=\"2025 Christmas Event\">2025 Christmas Event</a> tool that behaves very similarly to the <a href=\"/wiki/Material_Gun\" title=\"Material Gun\">Material Gun</a>. It does nothing without at least one of the four <b>Wrapping Paper</b> materials available at <a href=\"/wiki/Santa%27s_Workshop\" title=\"Santa&#39;s Workshop\">Santa's Workshop</a> for ❄️99 each.\n</p><p>Once you have a <b>Wrapping Paper</b> purchased, you can equip the <b>Gift Wrapper</b> and click it (there should be a highlight around it) to consume the paper. It will now be in the wrapper, allowing you to select the wrapping paper in the menu. Then, once a paper is selected, you can click on an item or structure to turn it into a boxed gift with the chosen wrapping paper texture, consuming the wrapping paper one time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Wrapped_Gift\">Wrapped Gift</span></h2><p>\nOnce an object or structure has been wrapped, it turns into a <b>Wrapped Gift</b> of a loosely similar size and shape. It will have the same <b>wrapping paper texture</b> as the one used to wrap it. These objects can then be <b>stored</b> or <b>unboxed</b> when held for 0.5 seconds, allowing for easier mobility and storage of some objects and structures. (<b>Trading</b> isn't recommended as the contents of the gift are never displayed, to allow for surprise gifts.)</p><blockquote><p><i>\"A special present, just for you!\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 512px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Wrapped_Gift_Before.png/revision/latest?cb=20251219153723\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Baby Ducky and Number Interface before being wrapped.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/20/Wrapped_Gift_Before.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/512?cb=20251219153723\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"512\" height=\"325\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Wrapped Gift Before.png\" data-image-key=\"Wrapped_Gift_Before.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Wrapped_Gift_Before.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Baby Ducky and Number Interface before being wrapped.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 512px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f5/Wrapped_Gift_After.png/revision/latest?cb=20251219153813\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Baby Ducky and Number Interface after being wrapped in the Snowflake and Tree Wrapping Paper.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f5/Wrapped_Gift_After.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/512?cb=20251219153813\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"512\" height=\"325\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Wrapped Gift After.png\" data-image-key=\"Wrapped_Gift_After.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Wrapped_Gift_After.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Baby Ducky and Number Interface after being wrapped in the Snowflake and Tree Wrapping Paper.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903122332\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019488/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.415      1 Template:Tool\n100.00%   29.415      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4813-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903122332 and revision id 20822. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Infobox_templates"],"links":[{"title":"2025 Christmas Event","exists":true},{"title":